    <!--Privacy Policy Message-->
    <string name="privacy_policy_text"><i>Last updated: May 2025</i>\n\nEMPlay does not collect or share personal data with third parties.\n\n<b>Account &amp; Authentication</b>\nIf you create an account, your email and display name are stored via Firebase Authentication. This data is used solely to identify your session and is not shared.\n\n<b>Local Storage</b>\nSaved movies and TV shows are stored locally on your device using SQLite. This data never leaves your device.\n\n<b>Third-Party Services</b>\nMovie and TV show data is fetched from The Movie Database (TMDB) API. Please refer to TMDB\'s privacy policy for details on their data practices.\n\n<b>Contact</b>\nFor any privacy concerns, contact us through our GitHub repository:\nhttps://github.com/huongtran97/EMPlay</string>
